<title>UK: Denmark sets $400 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets $400 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	COUPON     5.90 PCT  MATURITY    20.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.13     PAY DATE   S21.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
